# {{ project_name }} threat model

This is the project's STRIDE threat model: its assets, trust boundaries, threats and controls as they are on `main`, the known gaps, and the risks the owner has accepted.
It describes the current state, never a history (`.forge/docs-describe-current-state.md`).
`.agents/skills/security-docs/SKILL.md` writes and maintains it, always at design-tier, in three modes: bootstrap (fill in this skeleton), delta (a feature's or a design-exit pass's security content), and reconcile (bring it current against `main`, before every release).

